WEBVTT

00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:04.590
“Health” checks access and settings, and flags anything that hides a figure.

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:09.030
Open a row: it says what to fix, and where in Setup.

00:00:09.241 --> 00:00:13.581
Here, open the person, and edit their permission set assignments.

00:00:13.607 --> 00:00:16.367
Add the set it names, and save.

00:00:17.261 --> 00:00:20.981
Back in Admin / Setup, “Recheck” confirms it’s fixed.
